+// lost-recomp: Lost: Via Domus's Bink movie quad (RAD BinkTextures.cpp, DrawPrimitiveUP) arrives
+// with SQ_PROGRAM_CNTL.vs_export_mode = 7 (multipass), which this treated as "kill all
+// primitives", so every video frame was dropped and the screen stayed black. The movies play
+// on a real console, so draw such primitives (the translator ignores the export mode).
+REXCVAR_DEFINE_BOOL(gpu_rasterize_multipass, true, "GPU",
+                    "Rasterize draws whose vertex shader export mode is multipass instead of "
+                    "dropping them (needed for Lost: Via Domus's Bink videos)");
